Few hours into this game, already could notice few things:
- no Rocksteady: understand this as you want;
- bad voice acting: several characters had their voices changed (INCLUDING BATS ITSELF), and the new ones have terrible voices;
- the combat was
changed: ok for new players, bad for fans of the series;
- bugs and framedrops, a.k.a. bad optimization: again, no Rocksteady;
- bad aesthetics: all this tech thingy doesn't fit very well, the music is way too generic too;
- online mode, and f#cking online achievements.
For one side, the story is great, full of good points and characters (specially Harley and Joker's "birth"), but in the other, the gameplay is even more repetitive, there are even few investigation scenes and
